{"id":"pe_rola","lemma":"pérola","pos":"noun","rank":4681,"glosses":["pearl (rounded shelly concretion produced by certain mollusks)","a highly valuable thing or person; a gem","faux pas; blunder"],"ipa":"/ˈpɛ.ɾo.lɐ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/41/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-MedK1-p%C3%A9rola.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-MedK1-p%C3%A9rola.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"pérolas"},"examples":[{"text":"Essas pérolas parecem reais.","en":"These pearls look real.","words":[{"g":"that, that one","l":"esse"},null,{"g":"to seem","l":"parecer"},{"g":"true, real","l":"real"}]},{"text":"É apenas uma pérola de imitação.","en":"It is merely an imitation pearl.","words":[{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"only"},{"g":"a","l":"um"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"imitation"}]},{"text":"Estas pérolas parecem autênticas.","en":"These pearls look real.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/58628","words":[{"g":"this","l":"este"},null,{"g":"to seem","l":"parecer"},{"g":"authentic","l":"autêntico"}]},{"text":"Nunca vi uma pérola de tamanha dimensão!","en":"I've never seen a pearl of such magnitude!","words":[{"g":"never (at no time"},{"g":"to see","l":"ver"},{"g":"a","l":"um"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"very large, huge","l":"tamanho"},{"g":"dimension"}]},{"text":"Ela tentou persuadi-lo a comprar um colar de pérolas para ela.","en":"She tried to persuade him to buy her a pearl necklace.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to try","l":"tentar"},null,null,{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"to buy"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"to glue"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"for / to"},{"g":"she"}]}]}